    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing though... the 'who i am' was my movement. it was how i moved through space, the control i had. without that, there's no 'inside' left. it's just like a house where the owner died but the building is still standing. it's just... there. for no reason. it feels pointless to even keep the lights on in an empty house.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
