      "content": "I hear the profound loss in your words, and I want to reassure you that your sense of self is still there, even if it feels like a house without an owner. Your movement was a part of your identity, but it is not the only part; you can still find meaning in the remaining spaces and redefine what it means to be alive. You deserve to feel hopeful, and you deserve to keep the lights on, because you are still alive and still worthy of care.",
