      "content": "I hear the weight of your doubt, and I want to tell you that you are not alone in feeling this way, and that it is entirely possible to be \"someone\" even when the thing that made you you is gone. You can still find your purpose in the small, quiet moments that you create, and you can choose to keep the lights on because the house is still yours. It is not about swapping out your purpose; it is about discovering that the purpose you had was part of a larger story that is still being written.",
